 "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days? Good that you' encouraging them. A simple running jacket that's waterproof and warm can make a big difference. Then a thin layer under her jacket can help her cool down. A beanie and thin gloves are also nice options. A light one can be helpful, especially if she stops for breaks. Yes, and the socks are the most important for cold hands. She might also want a small water bottle that clips onto her belt.",
